            "detailed_description": "Senalux is a hex-based puzzle game about optics where you solve challenging puzzles with colorful lasers. Use the red, green and blue lasers, combine them to the right color and illuminate the target.<br>Senalux comes with many different optical components and over 200 levels as well as a level editor, so you can make your own puzzles and share them with others.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>based on real optics<br></li><li>over 200 levels with more to come...<br></li><li>two dozen different components<br></li><li>level editor included<br></li><li>community puzzles<br></li><li>runs on Windows, Mac and Linux</li></ul>",
